{"seq":1,"slug":"osint-fundamentals","title":"OSINT 基础理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/osint-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"osint-methodology","title":"OSINT 方法论与情报循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/osint-fundamentals/osint-methodology","wordCount":2235,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"osint-legal-ethics","title":"开源情报的法律与伦理边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/osint-fundamentals/osint-legal-ethics","wordCount":2299,"readingTime":10},{"seq":3,"slug":"osint-toolchain","title":"OSINT 工具链生态概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cybersecurity-applied/osint-reconnaissance/osint-fundamentals/osint-toolchain","wordCount":2415,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"osint-基础理论\">OSINT 基础理论</h1><p>本章建立开源情报的理论根基。从情报循环（Intelligence Cycle）出发，系统介绍 OSINT 的方法论框架，包括需求定义、信息收集、处理加工、分析研判和情报分发五个阶段。同时明确开源情报活动的法律红线与伦理准则——不同司法管辖区对公开信息的定义和使用限制差异显著，从业者必须建立清晰的合规意识。最后，全面梳理当前 OSINT 工具链生态，为后续章节的技术实操奠定工具基础。</p>\n"}